                 - Goethals</a></li>\r\n                            <li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Encyclopedia_Americana_(1920)/Volume_XIII:_Goethe_-_Haw\"\r\n                                    title=\"The Encyclopedia Americana (1920)/Volume XIII: Goethe - Haw\">XIII: Goethe -\r\n                                    Haw</a></li>\r\n                            <li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Encyclopedia_Americana_(1920)/Volume_XIV:_Hawaii_-_Index_of_refraction\"\r\n                                    title=\"The Encyclopedia Americana (1920)/Volume XIV: Hawaii - Index of refraction\">XIV:\r\n                                    Hawaii - Index of refraction</a></li>\r\n                            <li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Encyclopedia_Americana_(1920)/Volume_XV:_India_-_Jeffers\"\r\n                                    title=\"The Encyclopedia Americana (1920)/Volume XV: India - Jeffers\">XV: India -\r\n                                    Jeffers</a></li>\r\n                            <li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Encyclopedia_Americana_(1920)/Volume_XVI:_Jefferson_-_Latin\"\r\n                                    title=\"The Encyclopedia Americana (1920)/Volume XVI: Jefferson - Latin\">XVI:\r\n                                    Jefferson - Latin</a></li>\r\n                            <li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Encyclopedia_Americana_(1920)/Volume_XVII:_Latin_America_-_Lytton\"\r\n                                    title=\"The Encyclopedia Americana (1920)/Volume XVII: Latin America - Lytton\">XVII:\r\n                                    Latin America - Lytton</a></li>\r\n                            <li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Encyclopedia_Americana_(1920)/Volume_XVIII:_M_-_Mexico\"\r\n                                    title=\"The Encyclopedia Americana (1920)/Volume XVIII: M - Mexico\">XVIII: M -\r\n                                    Mexico</a></li>\r\n                            <li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Encyclopedia_Americana_(1920)/Volume_XIX:_Meyer_-_Naval_Academy\"\r\n                                    title=\"The Encyclopedia Americana (1920)/Volume XIX: Meyer - Naval Academy\">XIX:\r\n                                    Meyer - Naval Academy</a></li>\r\n                            <li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Encyclopedia_Americana_(1920)/Volume_XX:_Naval_Observatory_-_Orleans\"\r\n                                    title=\"The Encyclopedia Americana (1920)/Volume XX: Naval Observatory - Orleans\">XX:\r\n                                    Naval Observatory - Orleans</a></li>\r\n                            <li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Encyclopedia_Americana_(1920)/Volume_XXI:_Orley_-_Photoengraving\"\r\n                                    title=\"The Encyclopedia Americana (1920)/Volume XXI: Orley - Photoengraving\">XXI:\r\n                                    Orley - Photoengraving</a></li>\r\n                            <li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Encyclopedia_Americana_(1920)/Volume_XXII:_Photography_-_Pumpkin\"\r\n                                    title=\"The Encyclopedia Americana (1920)/VolumeXXII: Photography - Pumpkin\">XXII:\r\n                                    Photography - Pumpkin</a></li>\r\n                            <li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Encyclopedia_Americana_(1920)/Volume_XXIII:_Pumps_-_Russellville\"\r\n                                    title=\"The Encyclopedia Americana (1920)/Volume XXIII: Pumps - Russellville\">XXIII:\r\n                                    Pumps - Russellville</a></li>\r\n                            <li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Encyclopedia_Americana_(1920)/Volume_XXIV:_Russia_-_Silius\"\r\n                                    title=\"The Encyclopedia Americana (1920)/Volume XXIV: Russia - Silius\">XXIV: Russia\r\n                                    - Silius</a></li>\r\n                            <li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Encyclopedia_Americana_(1920)/Volume_XXV:_Silk_-_Sulphovinic_Acid\"\r\n                                    title=\"The Encyclopedia Americana (1920)/Volume XXV: Silk - Sulphovinic Acid\">XXV:\r\n                                    Silk - Sulphovinic Acid</a></li>\r\n                            <li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Encyclopedia_Americana_(1920)/Volume_XXVI:_Sulphur_-_Tramways\"\r\n                                    title=\"The Encyclopedia Americana (1920)/Volume XXVI: Sulphur - Tramways\">XXVI:\r\n                                    Sulphur - Tramways</a></li>\r\n                            <li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Encyclopedia_Americana_(1920)/Volume_XXVII:_Trance_-_Venial_sin\"\r\n                                    title=\"The Encyclopedia Americana (1920)/Volume XXVII: Trance - Venial sin\">XXVII:\r\n                                    Trance - Venial sin</a></li>\r\n                            <li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Encyclopedia_Americana_(1920)/Volume_XXVIII:_Venice_-_Wasmann\"\r\n                                    title=\"The Encyclopedia Americana (1920)/Volume XXVIII: Venice - Wasmann\">XXVIII:\r\n                                    Venice - Wasmann</a></li>\r\n                            <li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Encyclopedia_Americana_(1920)/Volume_XXIX:_Wasps_-_Zymotic_disease\"\r\n                                    title=\"The Encyclopedia Americana (1920)/Volume XXIX: Wasps - Zymotic disease\">XXIX:\r\n                                    Wasps - Zymotic disease</a></li>\r\n                            <li>XXX: Classified Index</li>\r\n                        </ul>\r\n                    </td>\r\n                </tr>\r\n            </tbody>\r\n        </table>"
